{"version":1,"content":"<p>開源加密軟件項目LibreSSL於2026年10月22日發佈4.4.0正式版。這是4.4.x系列的首個穩定版本，同時也隨OpenBSD 8.0提供。新版本帶來多項安全修復、性能改進和平台兼容性更新，重點包括移除存在安全隱患的eMudhra根證書、優化SHA-3算法執行效率，以及修復TLS、DTLS和X.509證書處理過程中的多個問題。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583568.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:42.745992+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:34:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.861481+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.861481+00:00","content_hash":"75df08e4ec538272bdfab31036bb7887d211920b66c5e6b185d97456e104627d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}